# Frontend migration Part B: the build stage's own `COPY . .` runs after
# `npm ci` already populated /app/node_modules inside the container — if
# a local node_modules ever existed in the build context (e.g. from
# running `npm install` on a workstation before building the image),
# copying it in would silently overwrite that with platform-specific
# binaries built for the *host*, not the node:20-alpine container. dist/
# is excluded for the same "never let a stale local build shadow what
# this stage produces" reason, not because it's sensitive.
node_modules
dist
.git
.env
